134	    /// ### TypeScript `type` aliases and `interface`
135	    ///
136	    /// - A `type` alias or an interface name are in [`PascalCase`].
137	    ///
138	    /// - Property and method names in a type are in [`camelCase`].
139	    ///
140	    /// - `readonly` property and getter names can also be in [`CONSTANT_CASE`].
141	    ///
